  "releaseNotes": "1.1.3: designer data-source entry now works in the .NET 6/8/10 out-of-process designer too (WinForms Designer SDK based smart tag); DataSource drop-down uses the built-in IListSource reference converter in property grid and smart tag on every TFM. 1.1.2: DataGridView-style \"Choose Data Source\" smart tag for the list controls (.NET Framework designer). 1.1.1: ListControl-style data binding (DataSource/DataMember/DisplayMember/ValueMember/SelectedValue), shared currency position and live IBindingList refresh. 1.1.0: Chinese reference manual in docs/; categorized toolbox tabs.",
